                          "content": "This Master Services Agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 8 August 2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Aldgate Holdings Ltd, a company incorporated in England and Wales (\"Client\"), and Meridian Systems Inc., a Delaware corporation (\"Provider\").",
