                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Following our call, attaching the June delivery log and the warehouse photos taken on receipt. Sixteen pallets show water damage consistent with transit exposure, not storage.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Inter",
                              "fontSize": 13
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "ZIeQR",
                              "name": "Eb3",
                              "fill": "$text-primary",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Our position remains that clause 6.2 of the carriage terms places risk with the carrier until signed receipt. We expect a substantive response on the claim by 15 August, failing which we will refer the matter to our insurers.",
                              "lineHeight": 1.6,
                              "fontFamily": "Inter",
                              "fontSize": 13
                            },
